msgid ""
"the review overlay (JavaScript, CSS, logo) in the danwos tool UI kit, "
"including the offline engine and the web script; sources in `js/`, built "
"with `npm run build` into `static/`; no Python logic"
msgstr ""
"das Review-Overlay (JavaScript, CSS, Logo) im danwos-Tool-UI-Kit, "
"inklusive der Offline-Engine und des Web-Skripts; Quellen in `js/`, mit "
"`npm run build` nach `static/` gebaut; keine Python-Logik"

